(7633881, 1237973, 94815, '<td valign="top">I can''t sense the wind or the murky water. Sorry. Instead, this has a haunting quality so far beyond those prosaic elements that I''m totally flummoxed by the title. What am I missing? I don''t think of egrets as night creatures; so that''s what makes this unnatural and a bit spooky. It''s my favorite in spite of my confusion.</td>', 'I can''t sense the wind or the murky water. Sorry. Instead, this has a haunting quality so far beyond those prosaic elements that I''m totally flummoxed by the title. What am I missing? I don''t think of egrets as night creatures; so that''s what makes this unnatural and a bit spooky. It''s my favorite in spite of my confusion.', '2019-07-01 00:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
