(7633916, 1238022, 173844, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely.  The foreground is already distant, then the scene skips beyond the strip of land to larger ships more distant still.  Their size only emphasizes their actual immensity.  The furthest one could be the rising sun.  The blue tone works in harmony with what we''re looking at.  I really like how the shimmer of the water is echoed in the grain of the sky.  And the composition is nicely compelling, half and half as it is.<br/>One of three personal favorites.</td>', 'Absolutely lovely.  The foreground is already distant, then the scene skips beyond the strip of land to larger ships more distant still.  Their size only emphasizes their actual immensity.  The furthest one could be the rising sun.  The blue tone works in harmony with what we''re looking at.  I really like how the shimmer of the water is echoed in the grain of the sky.  And the composition is nicely compelling, half and half as it is.One of three personal favorites.', '2019-07-01 09:04:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7633918, 1238020, 173844, '<td valign="top">Stunning, nuanced monotone.  Enough tones, transitions and textures to fill a gallery.  Lots of movement and dimension as the scene stretches away, the person embraced by the swing of the land, the dog venturing out into the sea.  Even the footprints in the sand serve to emphasize an eventual vanishing point.  I hesitate to ask if the horizon is tilted or if that''s the play of extended terrain, especially as the rest of the image looks right.<br/>One of three personal favorites.</td>', 'Stunning, nuanced monotone.  Enough tones, transitions and textures to fill a gallery.  Lots of movement and dimension as the scene stretches away, the person embraced by the swing of the land, the dog venturing out into the sea.  Even the footprints in the sand serve to emphasize an eventual vanishing point.  I hesitate to ask if the horizon is tilted or if that''s the play of extended terrain, especially as the rest of the image looks right.One of three personal favorites.', '2019-07-01 09:19:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7633919, 1238010, 96664, '<td valign="top">Not gunna lie... I haven''t been inspired this much by a photo in a long time. <br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Not gunna lie... I haven''t been inspired this much by a photo in a long time.  Well done.', '2019-07-01 09:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
