(7633921, 1238016, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and beautifully done.  I love the thin ribbon of land between sea and sky, one of my favorite takes in landscapes.  Its isolation really nails its distance.  Your choice in composition, emphasizing the monumental sky, is perfect, in my opinion.  The colors, too, are lovely, a symphony in the key of blue and white.  Delicate and strong.<br/>One of three personal favorites.</td>', 'Beautiful and beautifully done.  I love the thin ribbon of land between sea and sky, one of my favorite takes in landscapes.  Its isolation really nails its distance.  Your choice in composition, emphasizing the monumental sky, is perfect, in my opinion.  The colors, too, are lovely, a symphony in the key of blue and white.  Delicate and strong.One of three personal favorites.', '2019-07-01 09:31:31.000000', NULL, 0),
