(7633937, 1238007, 173844, '<td valign="top">Did he score?  Handsome sepia image, so iconic in America, and timeless.  The people on the other side of the stadium are perfectly tiny, as drawn in countless paintings and cartoons.  My seven should have been higher.</td>', 'Did he score?  Handsome sepia image, so iconic in America, and timeless.  The people on the other side of the stadium are perfectly tiny, as drawn in countless paintings and cartoons.  My seven should have been higher.', '2019-07-01 09:56:36.000000', NULL, 0),
