(7633942, 1237917, 173844, '<td valign="top">There are those runners in the distance rounding the bend in the road, and the tantalizing hint of of many more to come.  And of course they are "distance" runners.  Lovely lines, rhythm and composition, simple artistry at its best.  Terrific image.  My eight, should have gone higher.<br/>So vastly underappreciated it merits special notice for its distance from the head of the pack. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2019-07-01 09:18:16.</i></td>', 'There are those runners in the distance rounding the bend in the road, and the tantalizing hint of of many more to come.  And of course they are "distance" runners.  Lovely lines, rhythm and composition, simple artistry at its best.  Terrific image.  My eight, should have gone higher.So vastly underappreciated it merits special notice for its distance from the head of the pack. ', '2019-07-01 10:15:37.000000', '2019-07-01 10:18:16.000000', 0),
